msgstr ""

#: ../../../rest/system-pause-post.rst:6
msgid ""
"Takes the optional parameter ``device`` (device ID). When omitted, pauses "
"all devices.  Returns status 200 and no content upon success, or status 500 "
"and a plain text error on failure."
